<title>POLAND: Chemiskor Q3 net jumps to PLN 0.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Chemiskor Q3 net jumps to PLN 0.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemiskor SA results for the third quarter ending Spetember 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				0.08   vs    0.17</p>
